{"id": "19-297-2-7", "zh": "110. 有时为 e（kvace vā）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-298-2-10", "zh": "在以 a 结尾的名词之后，si 有时可选地变为 e。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-298-11-15", "zh": "gumbe、gumbo，gumbā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-298-16-24", "zh": "bho gumba、gumbā，bhavanto gumbā 等，其余变化与 sugata 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-298-25-32", "zh": "同样有 phussitagge、phussitaggo，vattabbe、vattabbo 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-298-33-73", "zh": "由于 si 变为 o 是必然的，本条是为了在某些情形下可选地变为 e 而设立的，所以它只在 si 变为 o 的那一选项中才成立；在中性范围内，e 本来已被“aṃ napuṃsake”（中性变为 aṃ）所规定的 aṃ 替代排除，但由于“bahulaṃ”（用法多样）的规定，中性有时也确实会出现 e，例如 sukhe、dukkhe。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-299-2-15", "zh": "以下承接“yossa”（yo 的）与“ṭe”（变为 ṭe）两项。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-300-2-6", "zh": "135. 在 ekacca 等词之后（ekaccādīhato）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-301-2-7", "zh": "在以 a 结尾的 ekacca 等词之后，yo 变为 ṭe（即 e）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-301-8-11", "zh": "ekacco，ekacce。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-301-12-17", "zh": "bho ekacca、ekaccā，ekacce。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-301-18-21", "zh": "ekaccaṃ，ekacce。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-301-22-28", "zh": "esa、sa、paṭhama 这几个词也是如此。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-302-2-6", "zh": "kodho，kodhā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-302-7-12", "zh": "bho kodha、kodhā，kodhā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-302-13-16", "zh": "kodhaṃ，kodhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-303-2-15", "zh": "以下承接“nāssa”（nā 的）与“sā”（变为 sā）两项。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-304-2-4", "zh": "107. 在 kodha 等词之后（kodhādīhi）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-305-2-7", "zh": "在 kodha 等词之后，nā 可选地变为 sā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-305-8-10", "zh": "kodhasā、kodhena。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-305-11-13", "zh": "atthasā、atthena。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-305-14-26", "zh": "从“我们从你那里得到了最上的利益（uttamatthāni）”一句可见，attha 一词也有中性用法。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-306-2-11", "zh": "以下承接“smino”（smiṃ 的）与“ṭī”（变为 ṭi）两项。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-307-2-4", "zh": "175. 在 div 等词之后（divādito）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-308-2-8", "zh": "在 div 等名词之后，smiṃ 必然变为 ṭi（即 i）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-308-9-13", "zh": "divi，同样有 bhuvi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-308-14-19", "zh": "在这里，ṭi 之前必然增加辅音 v，并且元音变短。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-308-20-23", "zh": "这里的 bhū 一词，其余变化与 vadhū 一词相同。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-309-2-9", "zh": "以下承接“ve”（可选）一项。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-310-2-20", "zh": "144. 在 mana 等词之后，smiṃ、saṃ、nā、smā 依次变为 si、so、o、sā、sā。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-311-2-18", "zh": "在 mana 等词之后，smiṃ 等可选地依次变为 si、so、o、sā、sā。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-311-19-22", "zh": "mano，manā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-311-23-28", "zh": "bho mana、manā，manā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-311-29-34", "zh": "mano、manaṃ，mane。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-311-35-40", "zh": "manasā、manena，manehi、manebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-311-41-45", "zh": "manaso、manassa，manānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-311-46-53", "zh": "manasā、manā、manamhā、manasmā，manehi、manebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-311-54-59", "zh": "manasi、manamhi、manasmiṃ，manesu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-312-2-7", "zh": "同样有 vaco、payo、tejo，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-313-2-6", "zh": "tapo、ceto、tamo、yaso，", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-314-2-6", "zh": "ayo、vayo、siro、saro，", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-315-2-8", "zh": "以及 uro，这些就是 mana 等词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-316-2-8", "zh": "在《Rūpasiddhi》中，aha 与 raha 两词被列入 mana 等词之中。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-316-9-18", "zh": "但由于 aha 属于 āpa 等词一类，raho 是不变词，rahasi 是形似带格尾的不变词，所以这里没有收录。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-317-2-18", "zh": "gacchanta 加 si，以下承接“sissa”（si 的）与“ve”两项。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-317-19-27", "zh": "此后我们一般不再标出承接项，因为承接的内容从释文本身就能看出来。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-318-2-4", "zh": "148. nta 变为 aṃ（ntassaṃ）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-319-2-7", "zh": "在 si 之前，词缀 nta 可选地变为 aṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-319-8-31", "zh": "根据“在明说的与推知的之间，与明说者的关联更强”这一原则，由于“ntassa”是明说的，所以变为 aṃ 的只是 nta，而不是推知出来的以 nta 结尾的整个词。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-319-32-39", "zh": "下文规定 nta 与 ntu 替代形的地方也是如此。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-319-40-47", "zh": "依“gasinaṃ”一条，删去 si。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-319-48-50", "zh": "gacchaṃ、gacchanto。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-320-2-9", "zh": "215. 在第一格的 yo 之前，nta 与 ntu 变为 nto。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-321-2-11", "zh": "在第一格的 yo 之前，nta 与 ntu 连同格尾可选地替换为 nto。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-321-12-19", "zh": "由于“bahulaṃ”（用法多样）的统摄，这一替换只用于阳性：gacchanto、gacchantā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-322-2-9", "zh": "218. 在呼格之前变为 ṭa、ṭā、aṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-323-2-16", "zh": "在呼格之前，nta 与 ntu 连同格尾必然替换为 ṭa、ṭā、aṃ，其用法多样。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-323-17-24", "zh": "bho gaccha、gacchā、gacchaṃ，gacchanto、gacchantā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-324-2-9", "zh": "92. 在 aṃ 与 sa 之前，nta 也变为 ṭa。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-325-2-10", "zh": "在 aṃ 与 sa 之前，词缀 nta 可选地变为 ṭa，ntu 也是如此。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-325-11-14", "zh": "这是有限定的可选规则。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-325-15-19", "zh": "gacchaṃ、gacchantaṃ，gacchante。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-326-2-16", "zh": "217. 在 sa、smā、smiṃ、nā 之前，变为 to、tā、ti、tā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-327-2-23", "zh": "在 sa、smā、smiṃ、nā 之前，nta 与 ntu 连同格尾可选地依次替换为 to、tā、ti、tā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-327-24-29", "zh": "gacchatā、gacchantena，gacchantehi、gacchantebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-327-30-33", "zh": "gacchato、gacchassa、gacchantassa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-328-2-5", "zh": "216. 在 naṃ 之前变为 taṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-329-2-10", "zh": "在 naṃ 之前，nta 与 ntu 连同格尾可选地替换为 taṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-329-11-13", "zh": "gacchataṃ、gacchantānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-329-14-18", "zh": "gacchatā、gacchantā、gacchantamhā、gacchantasmā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-329-19-25", "zh": "gacchati、gacchante、gacchantamhi、gacchanthasmiṃ，cchentesu。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-330-2-11", "zh": "同样有 mahaṃ、caraṃ、tiṭṭhaṃ，dadaṃ、bhuñjaṃ、suṇaṃ、pacaṃ；", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-331-2-11", "zh": "jayaṃ、jīraṃ、vacaṃ、pīyaṃ，saraṃ、kubbaṃ、japaṃ、vajaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-332-2-3", "zh": "等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-333-2-4", "zh": "bhavanta 加 si，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-334-2-4", "zh": "149. 在 bhū 之后（bhūto）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-335-2-5", "zh": "这是一条限定规则。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-335-6-13", "zh": "在词根 bhū 之后，nta 在 si 之前必然变为 aṃ，因为这里再次作了规定。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-335-14-15", "zh": "bhavaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
